"Each Impure Well hides a bone of a cursed skeleton rider at its bottom, which re-forms to guard it."
"Some Impure Wells are shafts the Demon King drilled to reach the black filth under the world."
"Impure beast young take the taint in the womb, and some were never clean at all."
"Impurities stick in a tainted beast; cleaned, it can be reinfected by its kin."
"Ice worms, huge crystalline and eyeless, burrow the northern wastes; mammoth herds shake them."
"In the void beyond the world drift beasts so vast a single limb dwarfs a mountain."
"A stronger being that beats a mana gorilla band may be obeyed by it; they pay back debts."
